@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Canonical snapshot left-inverse law in Set
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "Canonical topologies\n<latex>C</latex>" as source #6EE7B7
rectangle "Admitted bytes for profile\n<latex>B_{1,p}</latex>" as bytes #93C5FD
rectangle "Canonical topologies\n<latex>C</latex>" as result #6EE7B7

source -right-> bytes : encode <latex>E_p</latex>
bytes -right-> result : restricted decode <latex>D_p</latex>
source -down-> result : identity <latex>\mathrm{id}_C</latex>

note bottom of bytes #FEF3C7
The triangle commutes:
<latex>D_p \circ E_p = \mathrm{id}_C</latex>
end note
@enduml
